  "footer_note": "**Download only what you have the right to.** Use Starboard, its download apps and these plug-ins only for files you have the right to download, such as open-source software, works in the public domain and your own backups. Downloading films, series, music or books without the copyright holder's permission is against the law in the UK and most other countries. Starboard and its plug-ins do not host or provide any files, and you are responsible for what you download."
